The SKILL.md body and references/compatibility-and-tools.md adapt and
substantially rewrite upstream instructions and selected migration,
immutability, typing, and tool-safety topics. Changes include portable
routing, version-dependent framework rules, scoped preview/apply, preservation
of parallel work, explicit side effects, and incomplete-verification states.
These adapted documents remain under CC-BY-SA-4.0. Original UI metadata is
covered by the repository MIT license. No upstream scripts are bundled.
